diatimes.com/photo/135747808.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cong-mp-in-sex-abuse-row-on-manipur-poll-panels/articleshow/135747808.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cong-mp-in-sex-abuse-row-on-manipur-poll-panels/articleshow/135747808.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T00:49:40+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135747819,imgsize-237068.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Confident of trade pact ahead of PM Modi's trip: Canada envoy]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/confident-of-trade-pact-ahead-of-pm-modis-trip-canada-envoy/articleshow/135747731.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135747731.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Christopher Cooter, Canada’s high commissioner to India, expressed hope for the imminent finalization of the Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement. This agreement aims to bolster trade relations ahead of Prime Minister Narendra Modi's scheduled visit next month. Cooter emphasized that new international student policies focus on eliminating fraudulent schools while still welcoming legitimate Indian student applications.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/confident-of-trade-pact-ahead-of-pm-modis-trip-canada-envoy/articleshow/135747731.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/confident-of-trade-pact-ahead-of-pm-modis-trip-canada-envoy/articleshow/135747731.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T00:44:35+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135747730,imgsize-89998.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Green energy push helped India save $100bn over last 15 yrs: IEA]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/green-energy-push-helped-india-save-100bn-over-last-15-yrs-iea/articleshow/135747628.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135747628.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[India's remarkable leap in renewable energy capacity has led to over $100 billion in reduced costs for coal and natural gas imports. With 300GW of renewable power, the nation stands as the second-fastest-growing market worldwide. The International Energy Agency estimates that by 2030, cumulative savings could soar to $240 billion.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/green-energy-push-helped-india-save-100bn-over-last-15-yrs-iea/articleshow/135747628.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/green-energy-push-helped-india-save-100bn-over-last-15-yrs-iea/articleshow/135747628.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T00:37:39+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135747663,imgsize-76182.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘SOS’ call from Ladakh leaders &amp; Wangchuk, to President, PM and HM for poll deferment]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sos-call-from-ladakh-leaders-wangchuk-to-president-pm-and-hm-for-poll-deferment/articleshow/135747013.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135747013.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sos-call-from-ladakh-leaders-wangchuk-to-president-pm-and-hm-for-poll-deferment/articleshow/135747013.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sos-call-from-ladakh-leaders-wangchuk-to-president-pm-and-hm-for-poll-deferment/articleshow/135747013.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T23:59:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/