><![CDATA[UP polls: Owaisi, Azad likely to announce alliance on Nov 12]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/up-polls-aimims-owaisi-azad-samaj-party-kanshirams-azad-likely-to-announce-alliance-on-nov-12/articleshow/135745689.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135745689.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/up-polls-aimims-owaisi-azad-samaj-party-kanshirams-azad-likely-to-announce-alliance-on-nov-12/articleshow/135745689.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/up-polls-aimims-owaisi-azad-samaj-party-kanshirams-azad-likely-to-announce-alliance-on-nov-12/articleshow/135745689.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T23:16:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135745739,imgsize-57322.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Iran unveils underground 'missile city', warns US of strikes across region &amp; beyond]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/iran-unveils-underground-missile-city-warns-us-of-strikes-across-region-beyond/articleshow/135743033.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135743033.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Iran revealed a large underground military facility that contains various ballistic and cruise missiles amidst ongoing tensions. Senior military officials warned of potential attacks on American forces if conflicts resume, highlighting Iran's preparedness. The facility has been described as a missile city, showcasing its advanced military capabilities. Significant political leaders emphasized the need for the US to recognize Iran's conditions to resolve conflicts.]]